      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Epoch™",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "title_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Ultra-Low Jitter for PCIe Gen 6 and High-Speed Systems",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p><b>The Epoch™ platform is SiTime’s highest-performance jitter cleaner, engineered for:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>PCIe Gen 5/6, 100/200/400/800 GbE</li>\n<li>Optical modules, edge routers, and coherent optics</li>\n<li>Replacing bulky quartz-based jitter attenuators with programmable MEMS timing</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_3": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "SiT5801",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Integrated Phase Jitter:</b> &lt;100 fs typical</li>\n<li><b>Supported Inputs:</b> LVCMOS, differential</li>\n<li><b>Outputs:</b> 2 differential</li>\n<li><b>Frequencies:</b> 100 MHz, 156.25 MHz, 212.5 MHz, 312.5 MHz, 400 MHz</li>\n<li><b>Target Standards:</b> PCIe Gen 5/6, IEEE 802.3, CPRI, eCPRI</li>\n<li><b>Applications:</b> Optical transceivers, switches/routers, base stations</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_4": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Key Features:",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>Best-in-class PSNR (Power Supply Noise Rejection)</li>\n<li>Dual-output, programmable jitter cleaner</li>\n<li>AEC-Q100 grade options available for automotive/industrial</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_5": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<hr />",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_6": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Chorus™",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "title_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Low Jitter Programmable Clock + Jitter Cleaning",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Chorus-branded devices include integrated PLLs with jitter attenuation, phase noise filtering, and support for multiple outputs, combining low-jitter synthesis and clean distribution in a compact<b> </b>footprint<b>.</b></p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_7": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "SiT95210 / SiT95211",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Up to 4 differential outputs</li>\n<li>Programmable frequencies (up to 2.1 GHz)</li>\n<li>Supports LVPECL, LVDS, HCSL, LVCMOS</li>\n<li>Designed for jitter cleaning and generation in systems like:<ul>\n<li>10/25/40/100/400 GbE, PCIe Gen 4/5</li>\n<li>SATA, SAS, XAUI, Fibre Channel</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_8": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "SiT95314",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Dual PLL, 8-output jitter cleaner</li>\n<li>On-chip hitless switching, skew alignment, frequency translation</li>\n<li>Flexible PLL configuration for clock redundancy and cleaning</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_9": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "SiT5376 / SiT5377",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;MEMS-based, ultra-low jitter differential oscillators</li>\n<li>Often used in Chorus-style configurations for SerDes and FPGA reference clocks</li>\n<li>Compatible with PCIe, Ethernet, JESD204B/C</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_10": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Key Features:",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>Programmable PLL configuration</li>\n<li>Industry-leading low phase noise</li>\n<li>Seamless integration into existing FPGA/SoC clock architectures</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_11": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Product Summary",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "table_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Platform</th>\n<th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Products</th>\n<th>Key Features</th>\n<th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Applications</th>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Epoch™</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">SiT5801</td>\n<td>&lt;100 fs jitter, dual outputs, PTP/PCIe Gen 6 support</td>\n<td>Optical transceivers, high-speed comms</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Chorus™</td>\n<td>SiT95210, SiT95211, SiT95314, SiT5376</td>\n<td>Multi-output jitter cleaners, ultra-low phase noise</td>\n<td>Networking, PCIe, FPGA clocking</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
       "textIsRich": "true",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "",
        "1722939215525"
       ]
      }
     },
